flowchart TB
  subgraph BACK[Processing boundary]
    direction LR
    subgraph HOST[Trusted host]
      direction TB
      A[Store batch → Input with inputId<br/>Choose one processor]
      C[Input / run capabilities<br/>Assigned originals + staged writes]
      V[Validate all; create items atomically<br/>Host IDs; invalid → no items]
      S[Host-owned storage<br/>Explicit artifact set per item<br/>Shared references allowed]
      A --> C
      V --> S
    end
    subgraph WORKER[Untrusted Dynamic Worker]
      P[Process assigned batch once<br/>Read originals · write derived bytes<br/>Return 1+ publication manifests<br/>No ambient network]
    end
    C -->|read / write / transcribe| P
    P -->|1+ manifests| V
  end
  subgraph FRONT[Viewing boundary]
    direction LR
    U[Trusted host UI per item<br/>Search + readable fallback<br/>Broker checks item membership]
    I[Optional iframe per item<br/>Reads its explicit artifact set<br/>Opaque origin + sandbox + CSP]
    U <-->|MessagePort: artifact reads only| I
  end
  S --> U
